COMPILATION OF: E48B9

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48B9

   1 a 0000 E48B9:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1 r2] the automatic bit cell's ADDRESS next to the
   4 a 0006      pool and next to a varying cell -- E48A5 put `b' at 0002 with
   5 a 0006      the 2-byte 'N=' pool below it; here the pool is bigger, so a
   6 a 0006      shift proves the automatics start ABOVE the pool ([C114]). */
   7 c 0006   dcl name char(30) varying;
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1);
   9 c 0006   name = 'ABCDEFGH';
  10 c 0013   b = (name = 'EOF');
  11 c 0024   do while(^b);
  12 c 002B      put list('.');
  13 c 0042      name = 'EOF';
  14 c 004F      b = (name = 'EOF');
  15 c 0063   end;
  16 c 0063   put list('DONE');
  17 c 007A   stop;
  18 a 007D end E48B9;

CODE SIZE = 007D
DATA AREA = 0030
FREE SYMS = 385E
END  COMPILATION
